# env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# 🧨 Any BACKUP of an env file is still a file full of live credentials, and the
# patterns above do not cover `.env.local.bak-2026-08-01` or `.env.local.save`.
# One was created by hand during the PostHog key rotation and showed up as an
# untracked, COMMITTABLE file holding the service-role key.
.env*.bak*
.env*.backup*
.env*.save
.env*.orig

# R2 photo-migration checkpoint (resumable upload progress)
.r2-migration-progress.json

